1
00:00:00,200 --> 00:00:04,940
Respected evaluators, before entering that blackout zone,

2
00:00:04,940 --> 00:00:07,000
observe the opening baseline on both feeds.

3
00:00:07,150 --> 00:00:09,790
Right here at the 7th second mark,

4
00:00:10,170 --> 00:00:14,950
we pull down the notification shade
to deliberately sever location services.

5
00:00:15,350 --> 00:00:21,350
This replicates a sudden zero-satellite signal blackout as encountered

6
00:00:21,350 --> 00:00:23,850
inside highway underpasses and deep transit tunnels.

7
00:00:26,750 --> 00:00:32,690
On the left is our synchronized road ground truth,
and on the right is our real-time cockpit HUD.

8
00:00:32,690 --> 00:00:37,570
Notice the green indicator: GNSS is active,
satellite health is optimal,

9
00:00:37,570 --> 00:00:41,600
and position accuracy is calibrated to 0.7 meters
under clear open sky.

10
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:48,040
Immediately, the cockpit shifts into
emergency dead reckoning mode.

11
00:00:48,500 --> 00:00:53,640
Notice that despite zero satellite availability,

12
00:00:53,640 --> 00:00:56,200
the vehicle marker does not freeze, disappear,
or jump into surrounding terrain.

13
00:00:56,500 --> 00:01:02,660
Our on-device 8-channel Dilated SE-TCN neural network
is now estimating instantaneous

14
00:01:02,660 --> 00:01:05,500
speed directly from raw inertial vibrations.

15
00:01:08,000 --> 00:01:12,480
Under classical double integration,
accelerometer sensor bias compounds,

16
00:01:12,760 --> 00:01:19,380
quadratically causing positional error
to exceed 140 meters within just 30 seconds.

17
00:01:19,720 --> 00:01:25,240
In contrast, IDR-Navigator fuses our neural speed estimates
with a 9D Extended

18
00:01:25,240 --> 00:01:32,500
Kalman Filter and vector road clamping,
keeping the vehicle strictly confined within its actual driving lane.

19
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:40,960
A major failure mode in inertial navigation is road roughness—

20
00:01:40,960 --> 00:01:44,200
speed breakers and potholes typically inject
false acceleration spikes.

21
00:01:44,800 --> 00:01:50,560
Our Savitzky-Golay jerk gating filter actively isolates
genuine vehicle forward propulsion

22
00:01:50,560 --> 00:01:54,500
from chassis vibration,
preventing artificial speed surges.

23
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:02,680
Watch closely as the vehicle slows down.

24
00:02:03,140 --> 00:02:06,840
Standard inertial systems suffer from coordinate drift
when stationary.

25
00:02:07,200 --> 00:02:12,920
Here, our physics-coupled Zero-Velocity Update—or ZUPT—
detects complete stops instantly,

26
00:02:13,380 --> 00:02:17,600
freezing coordinate drift without relying on
GPS Doppler velocity.

27
00:03:05,000 --> 00:03:11,440
As the vehicle clears the underpass,
IDR-Navigator executes seamless satellite hand-off

28
00:03:11,440 --> 00:03:19,660
via our sigmoidal HDOP gate, eliminating erratic UI teleportation
typical of conventional consumer maps.

29
00:03:20,260 --> 00:03:26,500
This concludes Trial One with continuous, unbroken
lane-level tracking throughout the entire blackout.

30
00:03:31,500 --> 00:03:34,960
Now transitioning to Trial Two on the Sangamner Bypass.

31
00:03:35,700 --> 00:03:42,780
In this second run, we subject the system to an extended
multi-minute blackout over high-speed bypass curves,

32
00:03:43,080 --> 00:03:47,300
testing long-duration drift tolerance
and edge thermal stability.

33
00:03:52,000 --> 00:03:55,820
Observe how the vehicle negotiates banking and curve maneuvers.

34
00:03:56,160 --> 00:04:02,000
Our dynamic Mahony SO(3) attitude observer

35
00:04:02,000 --> 00:04:07,900
continuously separates centrifugal lateral acceleration from gravity,
ensuring heading angle drift remains clamped even during sustained highway sweeps.

36
00:04:35,000 --> 00:04:40,400
Crucially, this entire pipeline runs 100% locally
on the smartphone's edge NPU.

37
00:04:41,060 --> 00:04:47,880
Notice there are zero external wires,
zero OBD-II telematics boxes, and zero wheel-speed encoders.

38
00:04:48,180 --> 00:04:55,800
It delivers an inference latency of just 11.2 milliseconds
while consuming less than 8% CPU overhead.

39
00:05:15,000 --> 00:05:22,260
Even after thousands of meters traversed through complete satellite denial,
our vehicle remains locked to vector road geometry.

40
00:05:22,920 --> 00:05:31,400
The solution represents a robust production-ready architecture
suitable for mass-automotive, logistics, and emergency fleet deployment.

41
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:50,380
IDR-Navigator proves that high-precision vehicular dead reckoning
is completely achievable

42
00:05:50,380 --> 00:05:55,860
using nothing more than commodity smartphone sensors
and intelligent deep learning fusion.

43
00:05:56,320 --> 00:05:57,200
Thank you.
